---
source: crates/tk/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: "p.run(&format!(\"{command} --help\"))"
---
Inspect and edit the current local Plan

Usage: tk plan [COMMAND]

Commands:
  add     Include Tickets in the Plan; validate the whole batch before editing
  remove  Remove Tickets from the Plan without changing their state
  clear   Remove all membership, including unfinished Tickets; keep the Tickets

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
